And the panda teaches the little girl how to make five rides with the walk.

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:55.280
Panda was very clever in the kitchen.

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:59.720
I'm Michelle Castro, and I think you should read this book.

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:01.930
because it's fun and interesting.

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:05.490
And if you ever take a trip to China,

00:24:05.890 --> 00:24:07.810
you'll know exactly what to do.

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:12.920
Do you ever have adventures on your way to school?

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:15.690
I just read a book called The Trek.

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:19.440
It's about two girls who use their imagination

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:24.380
to turn an ordinary day into an exciting day,

00:24:25.140 --> 00:24:29.580
when the little girl takes her trek, which means journey.

00:24:30.190 --> 00:24:33.940
She sees animals in the middle of the city.

00:24:34.730 --> 00:24:38.290
The garbage bags turn into rhinoceroses.

00:24:39.210 --> 00:24:43.760
The laundry bags seem to be fish and sharks.

00:24:44.580 --> 00:24:48.920
The girl and her friend pretend they're in a jungle.

00:24:50.230 --> 00:24:54.170
Finally, they get to school safe and sound.

00:24:55.180 --> 00:24:59.900
I'm Caroline Tepper Marlin, and if you want to see some fans...

00:25:00.380 --> 00:25:29.970
pictures. Get this book. It will make you look at things in a whole new way. Can you imagine what it'd be like to be two inches tall? You'll be smaller than your toothbrush. Well that's what happens to George and George shrinks. One day George dreams that he shrunk and he woke up and found it was true.

00:25:30.060 --> 00:25:35.020
Even though he was small, he still had his chores to do.

00:25:36.090 --> 00:25:40.140
He had to make a bed thousands of times bigger than him.

00:25:40.920 --> 00:25:46.300
Did you ever try to brush your teeth with a toothbrush twice your size?

00:25:47.380 --> 00:25:50.060
The pictures in the book are the best part.

00:25:50.560 --> 00:25:53.940
They're so funny that you'll pop right out of your seat.

00:25:54.550 --> 00:25:59.830
This is a very silly story, but it did teach me something that you never know.

00:26:00.280 --> 00:26:02.740
What to expect when you wake up in the morning.

00:26:03.060 --> 00:26:05.060
Boy, I can't wait till tomorrow.

00:26:05.930 --> 00:26:12.110
You know, what we humans wear tells a lot about who we are and how we feel.

00:26:12.620 --> 00:26:16.920
But for our friends in the animal kingdom, there's an even better reason to look the way they do.

00:26:17.550 --> 00:26:19.790
Fashion is a matter of survival.

00:26:20.560 --> 00:26:23.720
But it's still fun to be like Imogene with antlers or peacock feathers.

00:26:24.030 --> 00:26:26.370
Or like a mummer in a lobster costume.

00:26:27.290 --> 00:26:29.010
Or like me.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:36.910
to sail with a whale of a tail I'll see you next time

